Package: unsaved
Title: Track and Guard Unsaved Changes in 'shiny' Apps
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Tanmay", "Chanda", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "tanmaychanda96@gmail.com")
Description: Tracks changes to input values in 'shiny' applications, marks
    changed fields, and guards navigation with a client-side confirmation
    dialog. Applications retain responsibility for saving their data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-GB
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: shiny (>= 1.7.0), htmltools, R6
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), shinytest2, bslib, withr, rewind, chromote
URL: https://github.com/tenmeh/unsaved, https://tenmeh.github.io/unsaved/
BugReports: https://github.com/tenmeh/unsaved/issues
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/markdown: true
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
